flowchart TB
  D[POST /incidents/id/decision<br/>reviewer = JWT sub] --> G[agent.get → proposed action, target,<br/>approval.request = the guard request the agent registered]
  G --> Q{guard request?<br/>none for escalate}
  Q -->|yes| M[GuardClient.decide: approve or deny it<br/>as a delegate: approver = reviewer, via the gateway]
  M -->|guard refuses: expired, decided, down| X[409 / 503 to the console<br/>nothing resumes, the incident still waits]
  M -->|recorded| A[agent.decide · tool token only<br/>no capability travels here]
  Q -->|no| A
  A --> U[incidents.update: status, execution,<br/>verification, timeline, TTM]
  U --> E{view has execution?}
  E -->|yes| AU[INSERT remediation_audit<br/>with guard request + capability jti]
  E -->|no| F
  AU --> F{status final?<br/>RESOLVED · CLOSED_NO_ACTION · FAILED}
  F -->|yes| R[release alert links<br/>a recurrence opens a new incident]
  F -->|no: REMEDIATION_FAILED · ESCALATED| K[keep alert linked<br/>the problem isn't over]
